      "id": "claim_d7748f9965734f80b8433848368ddbb3",
      "statement": "The brief requires at least one bundle concept per canonical document under docs/runbooks/, docs/decisions/ and the architecture documents, so the openwiki/runbooks/ directory now carries a concept page for each of the 21 live operator documents there: dev-environment-setup, local-dev, devcontainer-sandbox (primary) with devcontainer-sandbox-lifecycle (its lifecycle half) and devcontainer (the retained DinD path), android-emulator, e2e-testing, ci-diagnostics, ci-evidence-pipeline, sast-scanning, dast-scanning, infra-image-scanning, renovate, backlog, backups, server-setup, prod-control-tower, prod-data-tier-auth, prod-reboot-resilience, phase-15-operator-checklist, and wiki-maintenance; docs/runbooks/agent-layer.md is instead summarized by the architecture/agent-layer.md concept.",
