      "statement": "The brief requires one concept page per canonical document under docs/runbooks/, docs/decisions/, and the architecture documents, so the absence of a concept reliably means no such document rather than incomplete coverage; docs/proposals/** (pre-specification ideation) and docs/test-data/** (a binary unit-test fixture) are declared `excluded` in openwiki/policy.yaml and deliberately have none.",
