    {
      "id": "claim_9a3b78234ec7469296386df13b5be6bf",
      "statement": "A durable learning belongs at the canonical home of its subject, decided mechanically from the concept covering it: into the cited source when the concept is a derived summary, into the concept itself when it is authoritative, and into a newly added concept when none covers the subject — never appended to a derived page, and never to CLAUDE.md, which is an index into the bundle.",
      "evidence": [
