      "statement": "The prod host's nightly restic backup — its per-service dumps, checks, retention and the two independent alerting paths — is documented by the canonical infrastructure-as-code/backup/README.md, which the bundle covers with the openwiki/projects/backup.md concept; the quickstart's routing map points anyone touching backups or account deletion at that concept alongside the per-user collection backups runbook and the BFF.",
