    {
      "id": "claim_8e3d1813ac914456bb0e3cf542ebff60",
      "statement": "Governance rule G11 classifies a concept as derived only when its `resource` citation actually RESOLVES: a concept citing a path that no longer exists is reported as NEITHER derived nor authoritative unless it is also listed under `authoritative:`, so a dangling citation is a build failure rather than a quietly downgraded summary.",
