    {
      "id": "claim_328942eb89054a1abfe59abaeecdbe7f",
      "statement": "The two gates exempt the reserved bundle files at different widths: the governance gate's classification check skips all four (`index.md`, `INSTRUCTIONS.md`, `log.md`, `quickstart.md`) so a reserved file needs no derived-or-authoritative status, while the conformance gate drops only `INSTRUCTIONS.md` from validation and exempts `index.md` from the required `type` alone — every other file, the root quickstart included, is validated as a concept and must carry front matter that parses and a non-empty `type`, and its body links are checked by V14/V15 either way.",
