      "statement": "`openwiki/policy.yaml` resolves a path to exactly one of five declared states, and only two of them (`regenerate` and `event-driven`) are coverage targets. `excluded` means never analyzed and never written, and the write-permission check refuses a write there with the reason `policy: excluded — never analyzed, never written` rather than treating it as an unknown path.",
